        "title": "Listening Passage 1",
        "sort": 1,
        "content": "Listening Passage 1",
        "explanations": [],
        "questions": [],
        "vocabs": [
          {
            "id": 889560,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889561,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Hi Coleman, how are you?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 94.22,
                  "from": 91.98,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889568,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889569,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Good.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 94.94,
                  "from": 94.380005,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889572,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 95.1,
                  "from": 94.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889574,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889575,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: I wanted to have a chat with you because our friend Josh told me that you’ve joined a guitar group and it sounds interesting.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 104.59499,
                  "from": 95.715,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889599,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’d really like to learn myself.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 107.155,
                  "from": 104.994995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889606,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889607,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Why don’t you come along?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 108.91499,
                  "from": 107.55499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889613,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’m sure there’s room for another person.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 111.85999,
                  "from": 109.54,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889621,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889622,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Really?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 112.899994,
                  "from": 112.02,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889625,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So - who runs the classes?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 116.1,
                  "from": 113.53999,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889632,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889633,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: He’s called a ’coordinator’ - his name’s Gary Mathieson.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 118.899994,
                  "from": 116.5,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889641,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889642,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Let me note that down.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 123.78,
                  "from": 122.34,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889648,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Gary.... How do you spell his surname?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 128.195,
                  "from": 124.755,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889656,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889657,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: It’s M-A-T-H-I-E-S-O-N.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 139.21,
                  "from": 128.675,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889668,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889669,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Right, thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 141.21,
                  "from": 139.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889672,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889673,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: He’s retired, actually, but he’s a really nice guy and he used to play in a lot of bands.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 149.13,
                  "from": 141.61,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889690,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889691,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Thanks.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 95.1,
                  "from": 94.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889694,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So how long have you been going?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 154.35501,
                  "from": 151.475,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889702,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889703,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: About a month now.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 156.35501,
                  "from": 154.755,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889707,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889708,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: And could you play anything before you started?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 160.27501,
                  "from": 156.995,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889717,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889718,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: I knew a few chords, but that’s all.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 163.955,
                  "from": 160.755,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889727,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889728,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: I’m sure everyone will be better than me.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 166.355,
                  "from": 164.035,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889737,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889738,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: That’s what I thought, too.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 168.75002,
                  "from": 166.83,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889744,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "When I first spoke to Gary on the phone, he said it was a class for beginners, but I was still worried that everyone would be better than me, but we were all equally hopeless!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 181.71,
                  "from": 169.31,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889779,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889780,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Oh, that’s reassuring.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 184.005,
                  "from": 182.03,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889784,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "So where do you meet?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 186.965,
                  "from": 184.885,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889790,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889791,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Well, when I joined the group, they were meeting in Gary’s home, but as the group got bigger, he decided to book a room at the college in town.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 197.36499,
                  "from": 187.28499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889820,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I prefer going there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 199.83002,
                  "from": 198.31,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889825,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889826,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: I know that place.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 201.91,
                  "from": 200.39,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889831,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I used to go to tap dancing classes there when I was at secondary school.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 207.51001,
                  "from": 202.47,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889847,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I haven’t been since, though, and I can’t remember what road it’s in ... is it Lock Street?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 216.16501,
                  "from": 208.07,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889865,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889866,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: It’s just beyond there at the bottom of New Street near the city roundabout.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 223.285,
                  "from": 216.805,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889881,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889882,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Yes, of course.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 225.125,
                  "from": 223.44499,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889886,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889887,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: The guitar club is on the first floor in Room T347.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 227.685,
                  "from": 225.605,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889899,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889900,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.48999,
                  "from": 139.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889902,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And when do you meet?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 236.22002,
                  "from": 234.06,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889908,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Is it at the weekend?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 238.06001,
                  "from": 236.62001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889914,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889915,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: We meet on Thursdays.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 240.62001,
                  "from": 238.54001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889920,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It used to be 10.30 and that suited me well, but now we meet at.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 247.735,
                  "from": 241.26001,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889936,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The class that’s in there before us asked if they could have the room for another 30 minutes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 255.335,
                  "from": 249.415,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889955,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889956,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Oh, I see.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 256.695,
                  "from": 255.495,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889960,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Well, I’d love to come, but I don’t have a guitar.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 262.68,
                  "from": 257.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 889971,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 889972,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Well, you can always buy a second-hand one.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 265.16,
                  "from": 263.16,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889980,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "There’s a website called ’The perfect instrument that sells all kinds of guitars, violins and so on.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 275.21503,
                  "from": 267.0,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 889997,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’m sure you’ll find something there.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 277.695,
                  "from": 275.695,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890004,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890005,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: So what’s a typical lesson like with Gary?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 318.16998,
                  "from": 314.33,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890013,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890014,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Well, he always starts by getting us to tune our guitars.",
                "youpass_pick_words": [
                  "tune"
                ],
                "meta": {
                  "to": 323.69,
                  "from": 318.88998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890026,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "That takes about five minutes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 326.25,
                  "from": 324.09,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890032,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890033,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Uhuh.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 327.13,
                  "from": 326.65,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890036,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890037,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Some people have an app they use, but others do it by ear.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 332.875,
                  "from": 327.755,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890051,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Gary goes round and helps them.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 335.915,
                  "from": 333.51498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890058,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "And while he’s doing that, he tells us what he’s going to do during the lesson.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 341.675,
                  "from": 336.555,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890075,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890076,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Right.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 140.48999,
                  "from": 139.69,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890078,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890079,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: First, we usually spend about ten minutes doing some strumming.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 349.52,
                  "from": 343.91998,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890091,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890092,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: So is that using ... what are they called ... plectrums?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 357.105,
                  "from": 350.24,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890102,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890103,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: No - we just use our thumbs.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 360.785,
                  "from": 357.105,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890110,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890111,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Much easier.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 362.70502,
                  "from": 360.86502,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890114,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890115,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Gary reminds us where to put our fingers for each chord and then we play them together.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 368.86502,
                  "from": 363.105,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890132,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Sometimes we all just start laughing because we’re so bad at keeping time, so Gary starts clapping to help us.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 379.55002,
                  "from": 370.03003,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890153,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890154,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Do you learn to play any songs?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 382.67,
                  "from": 380.03003,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890161,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890162,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: Yes - we do at least one song with words and chords.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 388.235,
                  "from": 382.91,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890175,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I mean that’s harder than you think.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 391.035,
                  "from": 388.555,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890183,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890184,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Oh, I’m sure it is!",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 393.355,
                  "from": 391.275,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890190,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890191,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: That part of the lesson takes about 15 minutes.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 397.435,
                  "from": 393.835,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890201,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "He often brings a recording of the song and plays it to us first.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 403.86002,
                  "from": 398.58002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890214,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "Then he hands out the song and if there’s a new chord in it, we practise that before we play it together - but really slowly.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 414.75504,
                  "from": 404.58002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890238,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890239,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Do you do any finger picking?",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 417.87503,
                  "from": 415.475,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890246,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890247,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: That’s the last ten minutes of the lesson, when we pick out the individual notes from a tune he’s made up.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 425.795,
                  "from": 418.515,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890268,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "It’s always quite simple.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 428.54,
                  "from": 426.7,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890273,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890274,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: That must be hard, though.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 430.78003,
                  "from": 428.94,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890280,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890281,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: It is, but people like it because they can really concentrate and if we’re all playing well, it sounds quite impressive.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 441.02002,
                  "from": 430.86002,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890302,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "The only trouble is that he sometimes gets us to play one at a time - you know, alone.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 449.805,
                  "from": 442.285,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890319,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890320,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: That’s scary.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 451.965,
                  "from": 450.76498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890323,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890324,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "COLEMAN: It is, but I’ve got used to it now.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 456.12,
                  "from": 452.125,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890334,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "At the end, he spends about five minutes telling us what to practise for the following week.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 463.08002,
                  "from": 457.0,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 2"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": 890352,
            "level": 1,
            "value": "",
            "children": [
              {
                "id": 890353,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "WOMAN: Well, thanks Coleman.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 465.56,
                  "from": 463.72,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
                }
              },
              {
                "id": 890357,
                "level": 2,
                "value": "I’ll go and have a look at that website, I think.",
                "meta": {
                  "to": 469.385,
                  "from": 466.26498,
                  "speaker": "Speaker 1"
